00:06:19.669 --> 00:06:22.839
Yeah, absolutely so I think I felt very strongly that

00:06:25.490 --> 00:06:29.409
Basically this technology was transformative and that a lot of people want to use it

00:06:29.409 --> 00:06:31.330
